ame{cos}⁡2x\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int 8\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡4x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4(-\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x)+C \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008673/state.json" "file_sha256" "f0cb13d088b022db56deb1f0839d4c465912f56d5e2acf5c345df70dcd9ae9bb"} {"question" "q-74400" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008673/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "4630758fe7518876b4078da53f63d140afc115ff54e30376f6c8b26fc3d8c081"} {"question" "q-74400" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008673/state.json" "file_sha256" "f0cb13d088b022db56deb1f0839d4c465912f56d5e2acf5c345df70dcd9ae9bb"} {"question" "q-74400" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x+C"] ["math" "-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x+C"] ["math" "-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x+C"] ["math" "-\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x+C"] ["math" "-\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008673/state.json" "file_sha256" "f0cb13d088b022db56deb1f0839d4c465912f56d5e2acf5c345df70dcd9ae9bb"} {"question" "q-74400" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x+C"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008673/state.json" "file_sha256" "f0cb13d088b022db56deb1f0839d4c465912f56d5e2acf5c345df70dcd9ae9bb"} {"question" "q-10423" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate\n$\\int (\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-5)\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008673/state.json" "file_sha256" "f0cb13d088b022db56deb1f0839d4c465912f56d5e2acf5c345df70dcd9ae9bb"} {"question" "q-10423" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "In this case, we use the double-angle formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\n$$\n\nRearranging the above formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x=\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-5)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x-5)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x)-5x+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x-5x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008673/state.json" "file_sha256" "f0cb13d088b022db56deb1f0839d4c465912f56d5e2acf5c345df70dcd9ae9bb"} {"question" "q-10423" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008673/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "4630758fe7518876b4078da53f63d140afc115ff54e30376f6c8b26fc3d8c081"} {"question" "q-10423" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008673/state.json" "file_sha256" "f0cb13d088b022db56deb1f0839d4c465912f56d5e2acf5c345df70dcd9ae9bb"} {"question" "q-10423" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x-5x+C"] ["math" "-\\frac{1}{4}\\ope